@baseUrl = https://localhost:7600
@schoolId = 11111111-1111-4111-8111-111111111111
@templateId = 22222222-2222-4222-8222-222222222222
@notificationId = 33333333-3333-4333-8333-333333333333
@token = REPLACE_WITH_AUTHORIZED_USER_TOKEN

### List templates (current school administrator)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/schools/{{schoolId}}/notification-templates
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
X-Correlation-ID: notifications-example-01

### Create; TemplateId equals this first operation UUID. Exact retries reuse this UUID and body.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/schools/{{schoolId}}/notification-templates
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Idempotency-Key: 22222222-2222-4222-8222-222222222222
Content-Type: application/json

{"type":"LessonScheduled","subjectTemplate":"Your lesson was scheduled","bodyTemplate":"Open the Vairas application for lesson details."}

### Read one template
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/schools/{{schoolId}}/notification-templates/{{templateId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Update content
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/schools/{{schoolId}}/notification-templates/{{templateId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Idempotency-Key: 44444444-4444-4444-8444-444444444444
Content-Type: application/json

{"subjectTemplate":"Your scheduled lesson","bodyTemplate":"View the lesson in the Vairas application.","expectedRevision":1}

### Archive. Historical rendered notifications remain unchanged.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/schools/{{schoolId}}/notification-templates/{{templateId}}/archive
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Idempotency-Key: 55555555-5555-4555-8555-555555555555
Content-Type: application/json

{"expectedRevision":2}

### Authorized status; 404 for absent or concealed notification
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/schools/{{schoolId}}/notifications/{{notificationId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Cancel Pending. An existing authorized notification is required; no arbitrary send endpoint exists.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/schools/{{schoolId}}/notifications/{{notificationId}}/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Idempotency-Key: 66666666-6666-4666-8666-666666666666
Content-Type: application/json

{"expectedRevision":1}

### Stale revision => 409
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/schools/{{schoolId}}/notification-templates/{{templateId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Idempotency-Key: 77777777-7777-4777-8777-777777777777
Content-Type: application/json

{"subjectTemplate":"Changed","bodyTemplate":"Open the application for details.","expectedRevision":1}
